From f634b9f60bb6367961bc9fec6c19c454a45e2bdc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yanghan Ye <yyh94306@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 22:00:05 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 07/12] wifi: mt76: close NPU consumer teardown races

Make terminal teardown idempotent and keep reset completion from
restarting queues after the device has entered terminal shutdown. This
closes races between unregister, full reset, and NPU recovery paths.

Signed-off-by: Yanghan Ye <yyh94306@gmail.com>

